From: cezanne-bpf-backport <auto@local>
Subject: [PATCH] BPF backport: include/uapi/linux/types.h

回合自同代 MTK 树 mk7x7/android_kernel_xiaomi_mt6768@skyron
目标: 让 4.14 具备 Android 16/17 所需的 BPF 能力 (sk_msg / BTF / arraymap)
操作: 修改

---
--- a/include/uapi/linux/types.h
+++ b/include/uapi/linux/types.h
@@ -49,5 +49,11 @@
 #define __aligned_be64 __be64 __attribute__((aligned(8)))
 #define __aligned_le64 __le64 __attribute__((aligned(8)))
 
+#ifdef __CHECK_POLL
+typedef unsigned __bitwise __poll_t;
+#else
+typedef unsigned __poll_t;
+#endif
+
 #endif /*  __ASSEMBLY__ */
 #endif /* _UAPI_LINUX_TYPES_H */
